  "prior_evidence": "PR 28 accepted original fixture/controller-death containment; PR 31 accepted disk correlation; PR 32 accepted attachments/GPT denial; PR 33 accepted positive root/mount/swap use. Original manifests remain byte-for-byte unchanged. No new controller-death trial is claimed.",
  "limits": [
    "Five owned 64 MiB snapshot virtio fixtures and one boot-image disk; actual UFS root on 14.5 and ZFS root on 15.1. Multiple native boot-image members and broader controller/hardware support remain unqualified.",
    "One randomly named, single-leaf unmounted pool is created on HVM-UNIQUE-4K without force, with cachefile=none/compatibility=legacy/mountpoint=none/canmount=off, then only that verified owned pool is destroyed without force. This is a positive-membership fixture, not the product redundant creation operation or common feature-profile qualification.",
    "The actual all-pool catalogue binds to independently captured GUID/paired status/GEOM, including an unmounted pool. Missing-status denial intentionally omits its actual capture.",
    "Other four guest disks, baseline imported-pool identities/backing, actual root/mount/swap facts and all fixture identity/geometry are preserved across imported-pool test. Subsequent accepted UFS/swap test separately preserves its other three disks/root.",
    "Destroyed pool/UFS/signature bytes may remain on modified guest fixtures; no guest byte restoration, label/signature clearance, exported/destroyed pool absence or unused eligibility is claimed. Guest is discarded; all five original host backings/base/runtime inputs are preserved by snapshot mode.",
    "No complete device-use clearance, raw open-device use, local/shared-host fencing, durable enrollment/reservation, runtime collector/planner integration or product mutation authority.",
    "Adverse/unsupported/contradictory pool health, ambiguous/missing disk identities, overlapping membership, missing/extra/duplicate captures and resource refusal have portable behavioral coverage only. Syntax cannot prove successful capture completeness, freshness, authenticity or atomicity.",
    "Final PR-head portable review is separate; evidence/documentation changes leave all recorded functional/native inputs unchanged."
